WEBVTT

00:10:29.742 --> 00:10:32.271
DP: Well, the only thing
that could possibly be wrong

00:10:32.271 --> 00:10:33.804
is I couldn't find a silly pen.

00:10:33.804 --> 00:10:34.831
AP: To my princess:

00:10:34.831 --> 00:10:37.048
The weather outside today
is extremely rainy.

00:10:37.048 --> 00:10:39.001
I'll call you at 11:20 in the morning.

00:10:39.001 --> 00:10:40.817
DP: It's a romantic weather report.

00:10:40.817 --> 00:10:43.567
AP: And I love you.
I love you. I love you.

00:10:43.567 --> 00:10:46.666
DP: When a guy is happily married,
no matter what happens at work,

00:10:46.666 --> 00:10:48.823
no matter what happens
in the rest of the day,

00:10:48.823 --> 00:10:50.544
there's a shelter when you get home,

00:10:50.544 --> 00:10:53.097
there's a knowledge knowing
that you can hug somebody

00:10:53.097 --> 00:10:56.644
without them throwing you downstairs
and saying, "Get your hands off me."

00:10:56.644 --> 00:10:59.271
Being married is like having
a color television set.

00:10:59.271 --> 00:11:01.478
You never want to go back
to black and white.